      "filename": "Josephine. Robert Fairlie-designed locomotive, (16498125116).jpg",
      "title": "File:Josephine. Robert Fairlie-designed locomotive, (16498125116).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ee/Josephine._Robert_Fairlie-designed_locomotive%2C_%2816498125116%29.jpg",
